1
00:00:54,760 --> 00:00:56,880
Take a good look, all of you.

2
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:59,520
The General's Manor of Northern Jin has committed treason.

3
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:01,520
The spy, Li Zhi'an,

4
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:04,920
is the culprit behind your ruined families.

5
00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:08,600
Li Zhi'an,

6
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:12,440
I'll graciously let you die knowing the truth.

7
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:15,080
Traitor! Traitor!

8
00:01:15,480 --> 00:01:16,240
You national turncoat!

9
00:01:16,240 --> 00:01:16,960
Traitor to the nation!

10
00:01:16,960 --> 00:01:18,360
Traitor! Traitor! Traitor!

11
00:01:18,360 --> 00:01:20,200
Kill this traitor!

12
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:22,600
Kill this national turncoat!

13
00:01:22,600 --> 00:01:24,120
Your General's Manor of Northern Jin,

14
00:01:24,120 --> 00:01:27,520
has long been a hollow shell due to treason.

15
00:01:27,720 --> 00:01:29,720
On the day of your wedding,

16
00:01:29,720 --> 00:01:35,160
everyone in your General's Manor, including your father and mother, was slaughtered.

17
00:01:35,480 --> 00:01:36,400
Impossible!

18
00:01:37,280 --> 00:01:39,040
How could the Li family commit treason?

19
00:01:39,680 --> 00:01:40,880
I don’t believe it!

20
00:01:41,920 --> 00:01:42,800
Where is Zhu Huaichen?

21
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:44,240
Bring him here to see me!

22
00:01:44,760 --> 00:01:45,560
Li Zhi'an.

23
00:01:46,760 --> 00:01:48,520
It's a pity that you're blind.

24
00:01:49,560 --> 00:01:52,520
Otherwise, I would love for you to see with your own eyes.

25
00:01:53,240 --> 00:01:55,800
How Huai Chen killed your parents,

26
00:01:55,800 --> 00:01:59,520
taking their lives one stab at a time.

27
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:01,960
I don't believe it.

28
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:04,680
I want Zhu Huaichen to tell me personally.

29
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:06,440
Release him.

30
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:09,680
Do you really think the person who married you is Zhu Huaichen?

31
00:02:09,880 --> 00:02:12,520
If it weren't for the Li family's Longyu treasure,

32
00:02:12,920 --> 00:02:14,640
he wouldn't have kept you around this long.

33
00:02:15,200 --> 00:02:16,440
Li Zhi'an.

34
00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:19,120
Today, I'll send you on your final journey.

35
00:02:19,640 --> 00:02:25,960
In your next life, don't be such a blind and foolish person again.

36
00:02:28,240 --> 00:02:29,680
Kill that traitor!

37
00:02:31,320 --> 00:02:32,800
Kill!

38
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:04,240
Zhi'an!

39
00:04:19,760 --> 00:04:20,920
Zhi'an!

40
00:04:21,440 --> 00:04:22,400
Zhi'an!

41
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:27,800
Zhi'an!

42
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:32,320
Zhu Huaichen, why?

43
00:04:32,640 --> 00:04:35,480
No, I'm Zhu Huaijin.

44
00:04:38,800 --> 00:04:39,960
Zhi An

45
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:58,920
Zhi An, Zhi An

46
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:07,120
Where is this place?

47
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:10,160
Am I... am I still alive?

48
00:05:14,800 --> 00:05:17,680
Have I regained my sight?

49
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:22,600
Isn't this the day of my wedding?

50
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:27,880
How did I come back here?

51
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:52,480
Why are there bloodstains?

52
00:05:53,120 --> 00:05:54,720
Could it be that my parents have already...

53
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:39,160
No!

54
00:07:08,880 --> 00:07:10,960
On the day of your wedding,

55
00:07:10,960 --> 00:07:16,160
your parents and everyone in the General's Manor were slaughtered.

56
00:07:17,480 --> 00:07:21,640
My wedding day turned out to be the day my entire family was massacred.

57
00:07:23,200 --> 00:07:25,760
And the person I married wasn’t Zhu Huaichen...

58
00:07:26,200 --> 00:07:27,800
Then who was it?

59
00:08:33,280 --> 00:08:34,440
Zhu Huaichen...

60
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:38,480
You were even ashamed to put your name on the marriage contract.

61
00:08:38,800 --> 00:08:42,640
So be it. This way, we are cleanly severed.

62
00:08:47,480 --> 00:08:49,480
Heaven has given me a second chance at life.

63
00:08:50,240 --> 00:08:51,520
This time...

64
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:53,920
I will personally avenge my family.
